  "name": "Keymaster",
  "slug": "keymaster",
  "teaser": "Trader - BETA / WIP. The Keymaster currently provides you with fair key prices. Currently includes all keys for Labs, Customs, Factory, Ground Zero, Interchange, Lighthouse and Woods.",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2143.png",
  "downloads": 8791,
  "favourites_count": 0,
  "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Main</div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Keymaster - V0.6.4 (BETA / WIP)</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><em><strong>Please note, this is a very early stage, work in progress trader, expect bugs and weird behaviour.</strong></em></p>\n<p><em>I have done my best to make sure this is a stable build, however, it has not been tested to the absolute limit.</em></p>\n<p><em>This mod was a personal project, but I thought it would be fun to share with you all for feedback.</em></p>\n<p><em>The current goal is one update a week until all core features are added.</em></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jmoss-git/keymaster-art/main/Keymaster-Widescreen-Glow.png\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jmoss-git/keymaster-art/main/Keymaster-Widescreen-Glow.png\" alt=\"Keymaster-Widescreen-Glow.png\" /></a></p>\n<p><strong>Features</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>All keys for Labs, Customs, Factory, Ground Zero, Interchange, Lighthouse and Woods.</li>\n<li>Key chain, key tool and keycard holder are on sale.</li>\n<li>Loyalty Level Scheme.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Planned</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Remaining map keys to be added: <em>Reserve, Shoreline, Streets of Tarkov.</em></li>\n<li>All in-game keys added (V1.0.0).</li>\n<li>Fully integrated quest-line. (Post V1.0.0).</li>\n<li>Perfect balance for a normal playthrough.</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Loyalty Levels</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>Loyalty Levels Explained</strong></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Loyalty Level 1 (Min Level 1, Spend ₽0)</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>Recommended Mods</strong></p>\n<p><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1508-kaeno-traderscrolling/?highlight=scrol#overview\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">KAENO-TRADERSCROLLING</a></strong> - Essential if using multiple trader mods.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-5\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Special Thanks</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>Special Thanks</strong></p>\n<p>Being my first mod, this took a lot of learning, and the entire mod was built by looking at how other mods worked, specifically looking at <strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1412-painter/#tab_e4d770f78758b025999ab7fc95ca89cf37a202a1\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Painter</a></strong> by <strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/33069-moxopixel/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">MonoPixel</a></strong>, a mod I highly recommend you try out if you haven’t already.</p></div></div></div>\n",
