      "description": "<p><em><strong>V0.6.4 (BETA / WIP)</strong></em></p>\n<p>If you encounter any bugs or errors related to this mod, please let me know in the support thread!</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Added all woods keys.</li>\n<li>Added all Lighthouse keys.</li>\n<li>Added all Interchange keys.</li>\n<li>Removed a few log messages.</li>\n<li>Added new random log messages for fun.</li>\n<li>Updated trader image to fit with other traders.</li>\n<li>Changed the “Loyalty Levels Explained” section on the mod page to be much, much more user friendly!</li>\n<li>Checked compatibility with 3.9.3.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Total items: 79</p>\n",
